{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Manastorm: a Duo enters at the checkpoint its members unlocked in Solo (#8246)",
  "contract": [
    "Player report (#8246): the Manastorm window offered a group the depths its members had reached alone, but the",
    "server refused the entry because it kept a separate best depth per group size. The checkpoint gate now reads",
    "each member's best completed depth across group sizes on the run's track. Both level-30 players (Normal track)",
    "complete depth 5 alone: each force-starts Shadowfang Keep segment 19 at depth 5, kills its objective Rethilgore",
    "(3914) and leaves. Neither has any Duo progress. The Duo leader then sends the native enter request (1617) for",
    "depth 6, which needs a best completed depth of 5 for every member, and must receive ENTER_MANASTORM_OK and",
    "enter the private instance."
  ],
